  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> is a complex number, then the number of common roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>1985</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>1985</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>  </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>  </mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now solving,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ω</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now putting  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ω</mi></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>1985</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>1985</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>ω</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo> </mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>3970</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>200</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>ω</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> will not satisfy the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>1985</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence, there are two common root</p></blockquote>"
  }
